      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Spawns points are placed near points of interest and dungeons (Burial Chambers, Troll Cave and Sunken Crypts). Most spawn points only work once. Some spawn points only have a random chance of appearing.\n• Spawn points activate when there is a player within 60 meters.\n• The spawned creature has a 10% chance to level up (9% for 1 star, 1% for 2 stars), unless the level up is disabled.\n• Respawn timer starts ticking when the spawned creatures are killed, unless the spawn point is one time.\n• Most spawn points work both day and night (which allows daytime Oozers and Wraiths).\nBelow is an incomplete list of spawn points:",
